Jonathan Sobel: that showed up at the end of June. And in order to deliver all that, we had to impose certain restrictions.

32
00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:18.299
Jonathan Sobel: There are two big restrictions that were included in the… what was delivered at the end of June. One.

33
00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:38.630
